What is a GRC Platform?
Governance, Risk and Compliance (GRC) platforms are integrated software solutions that enable organizations to systematically manage regulatory obligations, mitigate operational risks, and maintain ethical business standards through centralized frameworks. These platforms combine policy management, risk assessment, compliance tracking, audit workflows and incident reporting functionalities. Available as both cloud-based and on-premise deployments, GRC solutions serve enterprises across sectors from finance to healthcare to energy.
